Out on the street, I wait for my bus.
It is cold today.
Many people stand at the bus stop.
A red bus arrives.
The doors open.
I get on the bus.
Here I scan my travel card.
The bus driver looks at me.
"Good morning," says the driver.
"Good morning," I answer.
I walk down through the bus.
I find an empty seat by the window.
I sit down.
The bus drives through the city.
Outside the window, I see many people.
They cycle fast on the bike lane.
We drive past a beautiful park.
In the park, people take a walk.
Now the bus stops at my workplace.
I get off and walk into the office.
